{
  "gmd_path": "ui\\00_message\\event\\st0435\\ev005.gmd",
  "arc_path": "\\event\\st0435\\st0435ev005.arc",
  "entries": [
    {
      "key": "",
      "read_index": "0",
      "tag_source": "source_en",
      "source_jp": "なんだ！？",
      "source_en": "What!?",
      "text": "Was?!"
    },
    {
      "key": "",
      "read_index": "1",
      "tag_source": "source_en",
      "source_jp": "隊長、みなさん、",
      "source_en": "Captain, everyone,",
      "text": "Ihr alle …"
    },
    {
      "key": "",
      "read_index": "2",
      "tag_source": "source_en",
      "source_jp": "ありがとうございました",
      "source_en": "Thank you.",
      "text": "Danke."
    },
    {
      "key": "",
      "read_index": "3",
      "tag_source": "source_en",
      "source_jp": "\"芯なる樹\"が元に戻っても、竜がいなくては――\r\nフィンダムは――癒やされません――",
      "source_en": "Even if the 'Core Tree' is restored, without the\r\ndragon— Phindym won't be healed—",
      "text": "Selbst wenn der Herzbaum gesund wird,\r\nkann Phindym ohne einen Drachen nicht heilen …"
    },
    {
      "key": "",
      "read_index": "4",
      "tag_source": "source_en",
      "source_jp": "セシリー！？",
      "source_en": "Cecily!?",
      "text": "Cecily?!"
    },
    {
      "key": "",
      "read_index": "5",
      "tag_source": "source_en",
      "source_jp": "新たな竜が――必要――です――",
      "source_en": "We need— a new dragon—",
      "text": "Wir brauchen einen neuen Drachen …"
    },
    {
      "key": "",
      "read_index": "6",
      "tag_source": "source_en",
      "source_jp": "待って！",
      "source_en": "Wait!",
      "text": "Warte!"
    },
    {
      "key": "",
      "read_index": "7",
      "tag_source": "source_en",
      "source_jp": "それが――覚者である――わたしの――",
      "source_en": "That's— the Arisen— my—",
      "text": "Dazu wurde ich erwählt … Das ist meine …"
    },
    {
      "key": "",
      "read_index": "8",
      "tag_source": "source_en",
      "source_jp": "竜になる前に――出会えて――良かった――",
      "source_en": "Before becoming a dragon— I'm glad I met you—",
      "text": "Ich bin froh, dass ich euch noch kennenlernen durfte, bevor ich zum Drachen wurde …"
    },
    {
      "key": "",
      "read_index": "9",
      "tag_source": "source_en",
      "source_jp": "わぁー（驚き）",
      "source_en": "Wow— (amazement)",
      "text": "Oh …"
    },
    {
      "key": "",
      "read_index": "10",
      "tag_source": "source_en",
      "source_jp": "わぁー（驚き）",
      "source_en": "Wow— (amazement)",
      "text": "Oh …"
    }
  ],
